ly glut&#x27;; a signed deal takes Brent from about $92 toward the high $70s, 15% below the standoff.</p></div></div><button class=\"linkish more\" type=\"button\" data-more>Show more</button></div></div><h3 class=\"sub\">Levels</h3><table class=\"cmp lv\"><thead><tr><th></th><th class=\"n\">USO</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Today</th><td class=\"n\"><span class=\"n v\">$138.17</span></td></tr><tr><th>No extensive strikes and no nuclear deal: the standoff continues <span class=\"otag\">Baseline</span></th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:133\"><span class=\"n v\">$131.98</span></a></td></tr><tr><th>The US and Iran sign a nuclear deal with no extensive strikes first</th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:133\"><span class=\"n v\">$112.18</span></a></td></tr><tr><th>Yes</th><td class=\"n\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:level:link:133\"><span class=\"n v\">$161.02</span></a></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"raw\"><a class=\"rawlink\" data-go=\"raw:value:consequence:link:133\">Full details</a></p>", "wide": true}